Comment: 0,0:16:42.31,0:16:44.27,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k28}I {\k28}remember {\k28}everything, {\k28}used {\k28}to {\k28}protect {\k28}you
Comment: 0,0:16:44.27,0:16:46.44,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k20}Where {\k20}did {\k20}you {\k20}come {\k20}from? {\k20}Been {\k20}lookin' {\k20}all {\k20}over {\k20}for {\k20}you
