Comment: 0,0:16:47.69,0:16:49.07,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k18}Thought {\k18}we {\k18}were {\k18}friends, {\k18}look {\k18}at {\k18}us {\k18}now
Comment: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:50.95,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k24}Fightin' {\k24}for {\k24}our {\k24}lives, {\k24}this {\k24}is {\k24}our {\k24}style
Comment: 0,0:16:50.95,0:16:52.99,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k26}Missed {\k26}you {\k26}bro, {\k26}this {\k26}deep {\k26}heat {\k26}from {\k26}within
Comment: 0,0:16:52.99,0:16:54.66,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k21}Been {\k21}such {\k21}a {\k21}long {\k21}time, {\k21}what's {\k21}your {\k21}story?
Comment: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:56.08,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k23}Where {\k23}you {\k23}headed? {\k23}What;s {\k23}your {\k23}purpose?
Comment: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:57.95,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k27}Thought {\k27}I {\k27}was {\k27}stupid? {\k27}Not {\k27}to {\k27}notice?
Comment: 0,0:16:57.95,0:16:59.50,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k19}We {\k19}don't {\k19}gotta {\k19}chit {\k19}chat, {\k19}talk {\k19}at {\k19}all
Comment: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:01.46,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k20}I {\k20}konw {\k20}every {\k20}thing {\k20}about {\k20}you, {\k20}my {\k20}enemy {\k20}and {\k20}goal
Comment: 0,0:17:01.46,0:17:04.54,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k26}We {\k26}used {\k26}to {\k26}shine {\k26}together, {\k26}fight {\k26}together {\k26}for {\k26}our {\k26}pride {\k26}and {\k26}honor
Comment: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:06.05,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k22}But {\k22}so {\k22}sad {\k22}can't {\k22}find {\k22}you {\k22}here
Comment: 0,0:17:06.05,0:17:08.21,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k24}All {\k24} I {\k24}see {\k24}is {\k24}a {\k24}madman, {\k24}lost {\k24}and {\k24}scared
Comment: 0,0:17:08.21,0:17:11.18,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k57}Drying {\k68}wind {\k31}takes {\k45}me {\k39}back {\k32}to {\k27}you
Comment: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:14.93,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k30}when {\k35}we {\k48}first {\k43}used {\k45}to {\k45}battle {\k31}in {\k96}justice
Comment: 0,0:17:14.93,0:17:17.93,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k90}Something's {\k84}different, {\k35}you're {\k48}not {\k44}here
Comment: 0,0:17:17.93,0:17:21.81,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k25}why {\k18}don't {\k36}you {\k28}tell {\k55}me {\k48}what {\k178}happened?
Comment: 0,0:17:21.81,0:17:25.48,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k45}I {\k37}guess {\k62}we'll {\k30}just {\k64}have {\k31}to {\k44}fight {\k34}and {\k20}connect
Comment: 0,0:17:25.48,0:17:28.78,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k33}(This {\k33}is {\k33}how {\k33}we {\k33}do, {\k33}this {\k33}is {\k33}how {\k33}we {\k33}rule)
Comment: 0,0:17:28.78,0:17:32.41,IN JP,,0,0,0,,{\k41}You're {\k37}not {\k64}who {\k28}you {\k46}used {\k48}to {\k37}be {\k41}but {\k20}okay
